<title>TUNISIA: Tunis bourse closes little changed.</title>
<headline>Tunis bourse closes little changed.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunis Stock Exchange on Monday closed almost unchanged in lower trade, bourse sources said.</p>
<p>The market's 30-share index closed at 617.49 from 617.38 on Friday.</p>
<p>Trade volume was 411,692 dinars against 452,087 dinars.</p>
<p>Chemical firm Alkimia was up 0.2 dinar to 44 dinars. Airliner Tunis Air up 0.14 dinar to 15.94 dinars. ($=0.96 dinar)</p>
</text>
